• onTaskComplete hook fires on every task completion, carrying the form variables
• getInstance() now returns .vars; task list queries attach node_config (with formFields)
• advance() passes the latest vars through routing — so when 处理审核 rejects back to 偏差处理， the loop re-entry resolves the current [变量:handler]
3. Designer (workflow-designer.html): each approval node gets a form editor — field variable name, label, type (text/textarea/select/date/user dropdown/department dropdown/currentUser-readonly), required flag, and comma-separated options for select fields.4. Tasks page (workflow-tasks.html):
• Approve modal renders the node's dynamic form; user/department fields use real dropdowns; currentUser fields auto-fill readonly; on re-work rounds the form pre-fills with the handler's previous submission
• Required validation before submit; form values sent as variables
• Detail modal now shows all three sections: 偏差上报 payload + each node's submitted form archive (归类 → 处理， in order)
5. Server (server.js): the onTaskComplete hook syncs deviation_owner/handler (flat vars) and writes form snapshots to classification_json/handling_json (matched by characteristic field names). Resubmit now clears stale classification/handling datasince a new instance starts a fresh round.
